öker du ärenden som registrerats före 2006-01-01 eller vill begära ut handlingar, kontakta PTS registratur på pts@pts.se eller 08-678 55 00."},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004359"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"PTS diarium"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q749568"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://catalog.pts.se/dokumentation/diarium.html"}}],"@id":"urn:source:fdab61310dddbc41ad4128a0c9430b7c53aaf91db972179abb2d9c2de33d1c5c"}]}
